<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers raised its rating on Lincoln National Corp to outperform from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The company said on Friday it would buy back up to three million of its 104.7 million shares.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-3/8 at 47-7/8.</p>
</text>
